@startuml
' REVIEWED_MAIN_2026_05_18: aligned to RBAC fast-forward 63739244; authority via RBAC program.
' LEGACY_NOTE_2026_05_13: this diagram may include historical ACL/receipt/tokenizer details pending upstream simplification merge; validate against current code before implementation decisions.
title Whitelist Management Sequence

actor "Permission Holder\n<<RBAC-gated>>" as Admin
actor "Investor" as Investor

box "RBAC Proxy" #LightGreen
participant "RBAC Program\n<<proxy>>" as RBAC
end box

box "Vault Program" #LightBlue
participant "Vault\n<<program>>" as VaultProgram
participant "VaultState\n<<PDA>>" as VaultState
participant "Whitelist Entry\n<<PDA>>" as WhitelistEntry
end box

box "Token Program & ACL" #LightYellow
participant "Token-2022\n<<program>>" as TokenProgram
participant "Token ACL\n<<program>>" as TokenAclProgram
participant "ACL Gate\n<<program>>" as AclGate
participant "MINT_CONFIG\n<<PDA>>" as MintConfig
participant "FLAG_ACCOUNT\n<<PDA>>" as FlagAccount
end box

box "Investor Owned" #pink
participant "Investor vToken\n<<account>>" as InvestorVToken
end box

=== ADD TO WHITELIST: Permission holder approves investor after KYC ==

Admin -> RBAC : add_to_vtoken_whitelist(owner)
activate RBAC
note over RBAC
  1. Check permissions[disc] == signer
  2. CPI into Vault with VaultAuthority PDA
end note
RBAC -> VaultProgram : CPI: add_to_vtoken_whitelist
deactivate RBAC

note over VaultProgram
  CHECK 1: Verify Authority
end note
VaultProgram -> VaultState : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault/src/instructions/acl/whitelist.rs#L14 verify vault.authority == signer]]
alt Not Authorized
  VaultProgram --> Admin : ❌ VaultError::Unauthorized
end

note over VaultProgram
  CHECK 2: Verify vToken Mint
end note
VaultProgram -> VaultState : check vtoken_mint == vault.vtoken_mint
alt Invalid Mint
  VaultProgram --> Admin : ❌ Account validation failed
end

note over VaultProgram, WhitelistEntry
  STEP 1: Create/Update Whitelist Entry
end note

VaultProgram -> WhitelistEntry : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault/src/instructions/acl/whitelist.rs init_if_needed PDA]]
note right of WhitelistEntry
  Seeds: [
    "vault_whitelist_entry",
    vtoken_mint.key(),
    investor.key()
  ]
  
  Space: 8 + VaultWhitelistEntry::INIT_SPACE
  Payer: admin
end note

VaultProgram -> WhitelistEntry : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault/src/instructions/acl/whitelist.rs set fields]]
note right of WhitelistEntry
  If new account (mint == default):
    mint = vtoken_mint
    owner = investor
    bump = bump_seed
  Always:
    whitelisted = true
end note

VaultProgram --> Admin : ✅ Investor added to whitelist

note over WhitelistEntry
  **Result:**
  Investor can now receive vTokens
  during settlement operations
end note

=== REMOVE FROM WHITELIST: Permission holder revokes access ==

Admin -> RBAC : remove_from_vtoken_whitelist(owner)
RBAC -> VaultProgram : CPI: remove_from_vtoken_whitelist

note over VaultProgram
  CHECK 1: Verify Authority
end note
VaultProgram -> VaultState : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault/src/instructions/acl/whitelist.rs verify vault.authority == signer]]
alt Not Authorized
  VaultProgram --> Admin : ❌ VaultError::Unauthorized
end

note over VaultProgram
  CHECK 2: Verify Whitelist Entry Exists
end note
VaultProgram -> WhitelistEntry : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault/src/instructions/acl/whitelist.rs verify PDA exists via seeds + bump]]
alt Whitelist Entry Not Found
  VaultProgram --> Admin : ❌ Account not found
end

note over VaultProgram
  CHECK 3: Verify Investor Has vToken Account
end note
VaultProgram -> InvestorVToken : verify account exists
VaultProgram -> InvestorVToken : verify token::mint == vtoken_mint
VaultProgram -> InvestorVToken : verify token::authority == investor
alt Invalid vToken Account
  VaultProgram --> Admin : ❌ Token account validation failed
end

note over VaultProgram, WhitelistEntry
  STEP 1: Mark Whitelist Entry & Close Account
end note

VaultProgram -> WhitelistEntry : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault/src/instructions/acl/whitelist.rs set whitelisted = false]]
VaultProgram -> WhitelistEntry : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault/src/instructions/acl/whitelist.rs exit() — close account]]
note right of WhitelistEntry
  Account closed via exit()
  Rent lamports refunded
  to vault program
end note

note over VaultProgram, FlagAccount
  STEP 2: Fund FLAG_ACCOUNT for Freeze
end note

VaultProgram -> FlagAccount : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault/src/instructions/acl/whitelist.rs fund_flag_account]]
note right of FlagAccount
  Create/fund FLAG_ACCOUNT PDA
  needed for ACL freeze operation
  
  Seeds: [
    FLAG_ACCOUNT_SEED,
    investor_vtoken.key()
  ]
  Program: Token ACL
end note

note over VaultProgram, InvestorVToken
  STEP 3: Freeze Investor's vToken Account
end note

VaultProgram -> TokenAclProgram : [[https://github.com/corda/corda-protocol-mvp/blob/main/programs/vault/src/instructions/acl/whitelist.rs invoke freeze_permissionless]]

note over TokenAclProgram
  Token ACL routes to ACL Gate
  callback for validation
end note

TokenAclProgram -> AclGate : can_freeze_permissionless callback

note over AclGate
  ACL Gate validates that investor
  is NO LONGER whitelisted before
  allowing freeze
end note

AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : validate whitelist_entry PDA
AclGate -> WhitelistEntry : check whitelisted == false
alt Still Whitelisted
  AclGate --> VaultProgram : ❌ GateError::AlreadyWhitelisted
end

AclGate -> FlagAccount : assert_permissionless_flag
AclGate --> TokenAclProgram : ✅ Freeze allowed

TokenAclProgram -> TokenProgram : freeze_account(investor_vtoken)
TokenProgram -> InvestorVToken : set frozen = true
note right of InvestorVToken
  vToken account frozen
  No transfers allowed
end note

TokenAclProgram --> VaultProgram : ✅ Freeze successful

VaultProgram --> Admin : ✅ Investor removed from whitelist

note over InvestorVToken
  **Result:**
  1. Whitelist entry closed (rent reclaimed)
  2. vToken account frozen
  3. Investor cannot transfer vTokens
  4. Investor cannot receive new vTokens
     in future settlements
end note

note over WhitelistEntry, InvestorVToken
  **Security Enforcement:**
  Removal from whitelist immediately
  prevents all vToken transfers via
  Token-2022 freeze mechanism
end note

@enduml
